			"notes": "A new item is added to the game that allows you to store items and magically produce them again. Let's not forget that it's quite fashionable as well.\n\nThe _Magician's Hat_ works just like a Bundle with a couple of exceptions.\n\n- Holding an item with the hat allows you to place it in the hat.\n- With an empty hand you can then make it appear from the hat.\n- You can wear it.\n- And if you place it down and wave your trusty magician's wand (a stick), you can summon items from the hat in block-form. Fireworks and spawn eggs have special appearances."
